# "<body>. When you do, <trigger>" [CR#603.12]. The reflexive ability triggers once for each time
# its event happens during the resolution, but once in all for a cost paid any number of times
# [CR#603.12a].
# TODO(spelling): Missing a Template for "$body. When you do, $trigger." when `body` is non-optional
# (*Blood Spatter Analysis*); `offerWhen` and `triggerThisWay` spell the optional and `$event this
# way` cases, and printing "When you do" for an absent `event` is outside `< … >` (`spelling.md` §7).
primitive triggerReflexively(
  body: VerbPhrase,
  trigger: VerbPhrase,
  event: Option(GameEvent) = none): VerbPhrase = TriggerReflexively
